Hi Paul,

I've not come across this issue.  Try un-ticking "Update effort in real
time" and see if that fixes it.  Also, I typically set the between-line
spacing rather than the total line length (since all Distance does when
you specify a total line length is try to guess what between line
spacing this corresponds to).  So, you could try playing with the object
you're specifying.  If you are still getting problems, send me a copy of
the project (exported to a zip file, and via some file transfer web site
as zips are often stripped from attachments) and I or someone here will
take a look at it.

Cheers, Len Thomas

